25
00:08:55,327 --> 00:09:23,327
That is, you will be given a text. What you need to do is, first, as you read the text, you need to find out the pieces of the author, or the main idea of the text, plus the supportive ideas given to support the thesis or the main idea. And how do we write? So as you read, this process is very important to just find out the main idea or the thesis statement.

26
00:09:23,327 --> 00:09:43,807
And the key points that supports that main idea or thesis, and one example or one justification for each would be enough. And if the writer has given any concluding sentences, you can also add it in the summary paragraph. And when it is time to write the response paper.

27
00:09:44,500 --> 00:10:07,500
What you need to do is, first of all, you need to write the summary paragraph. Summary paragraph has to be the first paragraph in the paper. And in the summary paragraph, let's remember the outline once more. We have to start by giving the title of the text, the name of the author.

28
00:10:07,988 --> 00:10:13,508
The thesis statement of the text given by the author.

29
00:10:14,068 --> 00:10:14,168
Okay.

30
00:10:14,548 --> 00:10:21,268
And after that, you need to give the key points that the writer introduces to support the thesis.

31
00:10:21,848 --> 00:10:32,248
But before each key point, it would be good to use sequencing words like first of all, second of all, moreover, in addition, whatever it is.

32
00:10:32,248 --> 00:10:32,508
Okay.

33
00:10:35,988 --> 00:10:43,748
It will be good to have one small explanation taken from the text.

34
00:10:44,148 --> 00:11:04,548
And after you complete giving the key points separately with one, just one example or one explanation given by the author of course, if the author, as I have said, gives any concluding idea, you need to just place it in the summary paragraph.

35
00:11:04,703 --> 00:11:16,783
And generally the summary paragraph has to be objective, which means that you never add anything from your mind. Okay, you have to be objective.

36
00:11:17,235 --> 00:11:42,436
And you have to use linkers or sequencing words so that the paragraph will have a flow. And please, please do not separate the summary paragraph into different paragraphs. It has to be just one paragraph. Okay? Never separate it.

37
00:11:42,624 --> 00:12:06,384
Just one unique paragraph. And of course we never copy paste from the original material. That's why please paraphrase the ideas. Rewrite the ideas. Okay? This is very important. And the second paragraph of the response paper is a response paragraph. Again,

38
00:12:06,772 --> 00:12:22,772
