41
00:13:19,155 --> 00:13:39,355
And then the topic and how you take the topic in your hands. That is your part, your idea, your perspective. Okay? So this is the content of the thesis statement. After that, you have to give at least two supportive ideas.

42
00:13:40,307 --> 00:14:00,708
The logical way should be to give one supportive idea that the writer introduces, but never just copy the supportive idea and paste it in your paragraph. You need to add something to it. Okay?

43
00:14:01,331 --> 00:14:12,331
